                    "weight": 6,
                    "featured": false,
                    "content": {
                        "en": {
                            "content": "**Direct Contact Information:**\n- **Phone:** {{school.phone}}\n- **City/Country:** {{school.city}}, {{school.country}}\n- **Address:** {{school.address}}"
                        },
                        "ar": {
                            "content": "**معلومات الاتصال المباشر:**\n- **الهاتف:** {{school.phone}}\n- **المدينة/الدولة:** {{school.city}}، {{school.country}}\n- **العنوان:** {{school.address}}"
